message: 'If you use Agent Fleet in your work, please cite it as below.'
title: Agent Fleet
abstract: >-
  Multi-agent orchestration framework for the Claude Code CLI. Runs specialized
  AI agents in parallel rounds (Conductor) or as stateful workflows with
  Postgres-backed crash-resume and Human-in-the-Loop (Conductor-LangGraph).
